# JSON Streaming Input Formatter — Phase 2 data-streaming
#
# Reads %stdin as a lazy Seq of JSON values using balanced-object parsing.
# Handles both NDJSON (one object per line) and multi-line pretty-printed JSON streams.
# Returns a Seq of parsed tinct values — one per complete JSON object/array.

[json: [include %libdir "codecs/json.llt"]]
[map json.from-json
  [json.balanced-objects [lines %stdin]]]
